      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel that is a tad iffy to implement, as you would have to label nearly all content on VRChat meme or not, and defeats the entire purpose of what the content gating filter is supposed to be about: making VRC a bit more comfortable for those that cannot handle gore, violence, or sexual themes and want to stay away from them as much as they can. Nearly all content on VRChat could be described as \"fan made\" content, which means you'd end up wanting to block about 60-85% of all content on VRC. It feels more that you are mostly against the concepts of potential meme/internet culture over general user safety.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
