      "value": "@{5fcd676570b59138e6ef0271|full_name}Who will pay for the server?\n\nCorporate projects pay far better than the average user.\n\nIn the Asian region, they are attached to corporate deals from large companies by dealing with pirated content, if not by quarantining pirated content.\n\nWithout such measures, VRChat will collapse due to money problems.",
