      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5baa1068e0b68928323f5213|full_name} as it stands currently there's very little sponsors and advertisements within VRChat. Most of the revenue coming into VRC is mostly derived from VRC+ subscriptions and partially the Creator Economy. VRChat is working more on making features that would make VRC+ more attractive to the average user. VRChat will comply to takedown requests if it is requested by the company, but again I think what you're asking for unrelated to the content gating system and misses the point of what it's purpose is: to ensure users have a comfortable experience in VRChat without concerns of seeing blood, nudity, horror, etc. This is besides the point that I think this is a really dumb idea to implement en masse since you're also begging for a purge of user content.",
